           Understand how Agentic AI works and how it can transform your business operations.
        </p>
     </div>

     <div class="faq-container">

        <!-- Q1 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              What is Agentic AI and how is it different from traditional AI?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Agentic AI refers to intelligent systems that can act independently, make decisions, and execute tasks 
                 without constant human intervention. Unlike traditional AI, it focuses on autonomy and continuous learning.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q2 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              Can Agentic AI automate business processes?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Yes, Agentic AI can automate complex workflows such as customer support, data analysis, and decision-making, 
                 significantly improving efficiency and reducing manual effort.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q3 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              Is Agentic AI suitable for small businesses?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Absolutely. Agentic AI solutions can be customized for businesses of all sizes, helping small businesses 
                 improve productivity, reduce costs, and scale efficiently.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q4 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              How secure are AI-based systems?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 We implement advanced security practices including data encryption, access control, and monitoring to ensure 
                 AI systems remain secure and compliant with industry standards.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q5 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              Do you provide support after AI deployment?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Yes, we offer continuous monitoring, updates, and optimization to ensure your AI systems perform efficiently 
                 and evolve with your business needs.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

     </div>

  </div> 
</section>
    <script>
    const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll(".faq-item");

    faqItems.forEach(item => {
        const btn = item.querySelector(".faq-question");

        btn.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();

            faqItems.forEach(i => {
                if(i !== item){
                    i.classList.remove("active");
                }
            });

            item.classList.toggle("active");
        });
    });
    </script>

